    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "course_id": "EDX1148",
      "rationale": "Building on the foundational knowledge from EDX28, this course delves deeper into conflict resolution, emotional intelligence, and communication techniques, which are crucial for managing conflicts and difficult conversations."
