      "course_id": "EDX3330",
      "rationale": "This course focuses on leading diversity, equity, and inclusion, which is essential for creating a safe and respectful environment for difficult conversations. The skills learned in this course will help learners navigate complex conflicts and difficult conversations in a diverse workplace."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "course_id": "EDX1421",
      "rationale": "This course provides advanced knowledge on high-conflict behaviors, which is essential for managing difficult conversations and conflicts in a workplace setting. The skills learned in this course will help learners respond effectively to high-conflict situations."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "course_id": "EDX1697",
      "rationale": "This course focuses on intercultural communication, which is essential for navigating complex conflicts and difficult conversations in a globalized workplace. The skills learned in this course will help learners communicate effectively across cultural boundaries."
    }
  ]
}

